---
// /quick-start - the Quick-Start Guide DELIVERY page.
//
// This is where the guide email sends every new subscriber. It replaces the
// systeme.io page at /quick-start-video-landing, which dies at DNS cutover and
// which every guide email ever sent still points at. The 301 from the old URL
// is a critical launch item (PRD site map).
//
// THE OLD SPECIAL-PRICE BLOCK IS DELIBERATELY GONE (Jon, 2026-08-14):
// "$48/month locked in forever", the $147 regular price, and the QUICKSTART
// promo code all conflict with the 3-month model and with community-page-spec.md
// (kill codes, kill the $147 anchor, kill price-lock language). Nobody ever
// joined the community, so there is nobody grandfathered into the old rate.
// DO NOT re-add a discount here without a recorded decision.
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';
import VideoEmbed from '../components/VideoEmbed.astro';
import '../styles/home.css';
---

{/* UNLISTED (Jon, 2026-08-14): reached only from the guide email. Not in nav,
     not in the footer, not linked from any page, and noindex so it stays out of
     search results even once the URL is out in the wild. Do not link to it. */}
<Base
  title="Your Quit Smoking & Vaping Quick-Start Guide | Always Be Quitting"
  description="The simple 5-minute technique that jumpstarts your quitting attempt."
  noindex
>
  <SiteHeader />

  <main class="band band--mist" style="padding-block: var(--section-xs)">
    <div class="wrap wrap--media">
      <h1 class="display-lg hl" style="text-align:center">
        Here's your <em>Quick-Start Guide.</em>
      </h1>
      <p class="lede" style="color:var(--soft); font-size: var(--text-base)">
        This simple 5-minute technique will jumpstart your quitting attempt. Watch it whenever you're
        ready, and come back to it as often as you need.
      </p>

      <div class="reveal">
        <VideoEmbed
          src720="/video/quickstart-720p.mp4"
          src480="/video/quickstart-480p.mp4"
          poster="/video/quickstart-poster.webp"
          posterMobile="/video/quickstart-poster-480.webp"
          posterFallback="/video/quickstart-poster.jpg"
          title="This simple 5-minute technique will jumpstart your quitting attempt"
        />
      </div>

      <p style="text-align:center; color:var(--soft); margin-top: var(--gap-md); font-size: var(--text-md)">
        You'll also start getting <strong>ABQ Tips</strong> by email. Short, practical, and you can
        stop any time.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>

  {/* DELIVERY PAGE, NOT A SALES PAGE (Jon, 2026-08-21): "the quick-start purpose
       is just as the link to serve to the email that they get... people will get
       the sales job in the email that has this link. it is not a page per se."

       So: no pitch here. The email that carries this link does the selling, and
       repeating it would duplicate that job on a page someone opened to watch a
       video. Three plain links only - homepage, community, 1:1 - per Jon.

       A previous version of this section carried a full two-door sales pitch.
       That was wrong for this page. Do not reinstate it.

       Historical note: the live systeme.io page put a "$48/month locked in
       forever / regular $147 / Promo Code QUICKSTART" block here. That offer is
       dead - see the header comment. Never re-add a discount to this page. */}
  <section class="band band--white" style="padding-block: var(--section-xs)">
    <div class="wrap wrap--media" style="text-align:center">
      <p style="color:var(--soft); margin:0 0 0.9rem; font-size: var(--text-md)">More about how I can help:</p>
      <p class="qs-links">
        <a href="/">Always Be Quitting</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
        <a href="/community">The ABQ Community</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
        <a href="/coaching">1:1 Coaching</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <SiteFooter />
</Base>

<style>
  .qs-links {
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.6rem 1rem;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: baseline;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .qs-links a {
    color: var(--blue);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 2px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--blue) 35%, transparent);
  }
  .qs-links a:hover {
    border-bottom-color: var(--blue);
  }
  .qs-links span {
    color: var(--soft);
  }
</style>
